ok 1 - should be able to score a game with all zeros
ok 2 - should be able to score a game with no strikes or spares
ok 3 - a spare followed by zeros is worth ten points
ok 4 - points scored in the roll after a spare are counted twice
ok 5 - consecutive spares each get a one roll bonus
ok 6 - a spare in the last frame gets a one roll bonus that is counted once
ok 7 - a strike earns ten points in a frame with a single roll
ok 8 - points scored in the two rolls after a strike are counted twice as a bonus
ok 9 - consecutive strikes each get the two roll bonus
ok 10 - a strike in the last frame gets a two roll bonus that is counted once
ok 11 - rolling a spare with the two roll bonus does not get a bonus roll
ok 12 - strikes with the two roll bonus do not get bonus rolls
ok 13 - last two strikes followed by only last bonus with non strike points
ok 14 - a strike with the one roll bonus after a spare in the last frame does not get a bonus
ok 15 - all strikes is a perfect game
# Subtest: rolls cannot score negative points
    1..3
    ok 1 - code dies
    ok 2 - right exception type (X::Bowling::NegativePins)
    ok 3 - .message matches /^ "Negative roll is invalid" $/
ok 16 - rolls cannot score negative points
# Subtest: a roll cannot score more than 10 points
    1..3
    ok 1 - code dies
    ok 2 - right exception type (X::Bowling::TooManyPins)
    ok 3 - .message matches /^ "Pin count exceeds pins on the lane" $/
